thilda in Mobile Legends: Roam Dire Hit Burst\",\"description\":\"Damage roam setup for pickoff drafts. Mathilda charges Ancestral Guidance and Dire Hit Force off the same constant movement, so the enhanced Basic Attack carries the stack dump into Circling Eagle, Soul Bloom, and Execute.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Execute Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Arcane Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Arcane Boots (690 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Ice Queen Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Ice Queen Wand (2,040 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Blood Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blood Wings (2,100 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Dire Hit Burst build for Mathilda.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda#build-roam-dire-hit-burst\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/mathilda\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":102,\"name\":\"Mathilda\",\"slug\":\"mathilda\",\"title\":\"Swift Plume\",\"role\":[\"Support\",\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Initiator\",\"Guard\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"D\",\"difficulty\":3,\"releaseYear\":2020,\"stats\":{\"durability\":80,\"offense\":20,\"controlEffect\":40,\"difficulty\":70},\"winRate\":44.81,\"pickRate\":0.14,\"banRate\":0.19,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"gord\",\"heroName\":\"Gord\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Mathilda excels in harassment and single-target CC, making her a great counter to squishy heroes with no escape skills, like Gord and Vale.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"vale\",\"heroName\":\"Vale\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Mathilda excels in harassment and single-target CC, making her a great counter to squishy heroes with no escape skills, like Gord and Vale.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Mathilda is countered by Tanks with multiple CC skills, such as Franco and Minsitthar.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Mathilda is countered by Tanks with multiple CC skills, such as Franco and Minsitthar.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_5d6eb0491da5709648beca54f906c0a3.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_24d08ed788a9f5984bcf3b732ddcaf04.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"93\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a2f68d5c30c0198006b2c85b7a5cb48b.png\",\"tip\":\"Atlas\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"96\",\"heroName\":\"Luo Yi\",\"heroSlug\":\"luo-yi\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_c9f30c0ebde489a34b70ba1064c6fb02.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Luo Yi\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"89\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_d744e6f02ba1d9b5f246a5532cc2b201.png\",\"tip\":\"Wanwan\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Ancestral Guidance\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Mathilda gains Ancestral Guidance while moving. When it's fully charged, her next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 200 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target and granting her 80 extra Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mathilda gains \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ancestral Guidance\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" while moving. When it's fully charged, her next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"(+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to the target and granting her 80 extra Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f201e693e1129614b1b22047e28a4c2c.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Soul Bloom\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Mathilda resonates with the power of her ancestors for 4s, attracting wisps as her movement distance increases (up to 6 wisps).\\n\\nAt the end of the skill's duration, or when Mathilda casts this skill again, the wisps will seek and attack nearby enemies, each dealing 275 (+125% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and revealing the enemies' positions briefly. Subsequent damage dealt by wisps to the same target decays to 40%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mathilda resonates with the power of her ancestors for 4s, attracting wisps as her movement distance increases (up to 6 wisps).\\n\\nAt the end of the skill's duration, or when Mathilda casts this skill again, the wisps will seek and attack nearby enemies, each dealing 275\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+125% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and revealing the enemies' positions briefly. Subsequent damage dealt by wisps to the same target decays to 40%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"50\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4b41810acba280a3b6e9bba321bfbb74.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\"]},{\"name\":\"Guiding Wind\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Mathilda leaps in the target direction and creates a field around her, gaining a 350 (+180% Total Magic Power) shield and 25% extra Movement Speed for 3s. Allied heroes who come into contact with the field will receive a 50% shield and Guiding Wind. The first allied hero that triggers Guiding Wind will be guided to Mathilda, and both of them will gain the same Movement Speed boost.\\n\\nWhen casting this skill during Circling Eagle, Mathilda won't change her position.\\nGuiding Wind expires 2s after the hero leaves Mathilda's field.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mathilda leaps in the target direction and creates a field around her, gaining a 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+180% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield and 25% extra Movement Speed for 3s. Allied heroes who come into contact with the field will receive a 50% shield and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Guiding Wind\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". The first allied hero that triggers \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Guiding Wind\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" will be guided to Mathilda, and both of them will gain the same Movement Speed boost.\\n\\nWhen casting this skill during \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Circling Eagle\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", Mathilda won't change her position.\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Guiding Wind\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" expires 2s after the hero leaves Mathilda's field.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"13.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9c364f42f896209e76c50e9460a9395e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Shield\"]},{\"name\":\"Circling Eagle\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Mathilda applies a Soul Mark to the target enemy hero and circles around them for up to 3.5s, during which her wisps will fly into nearby enemies, each dealing 40 (+15% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. The Soul Mark will also slow the target by 15% and Soul Bloom will prioritize the target with Soul Mark.\\nWithin the duration, Mathilda can select an area to dash to. At the end of the duration, she'll dash at the target with Soul Mark, dealing 320 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage while knocking enemies in her path airborne for 0.6s, transferring the Soul Mark to the first enemy hero that she knocks airborne, and reducing the skill cooldown by 40%.\\nMathilda gains Control Immunity and a 400 (+180% Total Magic Power) shield for the skill duration.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Mathilda applies a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Soul Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target enemy hero and circles around them for up to 3.5s, during which her wisps will fly into nearby enemies, each dealing 40\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+15% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage. The Soul Mark will also slow the target by 15% and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Soul Bloom\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" will prioritize the target with Soul Mark.\\nWithin the duration, Mathilda can select an area to dash to. At the end of the duration, she'll dash at the target with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Soul Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", dealing 320\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage while knocking enemies in her path airborne for 0.6s, transferring the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Soul Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the first enemy hero that she knocks airborne, and reducing the skill cooldown by 40%.\\nMathilda gains Control Immunity and a 400\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+180% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" shield for the skill duration.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"65s\",\"manaCost\":\"120\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9dade03c4d55cf327e9f1cb279e99f29.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"Shield\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Mathilda works well with high burst damage heroes who can use Guiding Wind and follow up her Ultimate to secure kills, such as Saber and Eudora.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Mathilda works well with high burst damage heroes who can use Guiding Wind and follow up her Ultimate to secure kills, such as Saber and Eudora.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, first activate Mathilda's 1st skill,\\r\\nthen immediately use her 2nd Skill to get to a good position to initiate from\\r\\nand unleash her Ultimate on the primary target. This combo allows Mathilda to quickly CC a key enemy hero, and lets an ally follow up by using Guiding Wind from her 2nd Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10210,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4b41810acba280a3b6e9bba321bfbb74.png\"},{\"skillId\":10220,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9c364f42f896209e76c50e9460a9395e.png\"},{\"skillId\":10230,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9dade03c4d55cf327e9f1cb279e99f29.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, use Mathilda's 1st Skill in advance and keep moving to gather wisps, then use her 2nd Skill to get close to the enemy\\r\\nand unleash all her wisps at the target before ending with an enhanced Basic Attack. Use her Ultimate to secure the kill if the enemy is low on HP.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":10210,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4b41810acba280a3b6e9bba321bfbb74.png\"},{\"skillId\":10220,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9c364f42f896209e76c50e9460a9395e.png\"},{\"skillId\":10200,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":10230,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9dade03c4d55cf327e9f1cb279e99f29.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Mathilda build, counter, and guide for MLBB. Circling Eagle timing, Guiding Wind delivery, Fleeting Time spike, and when your draft is not ready for her.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Mathilda is not a fighter who happens to support. She is a delivery system dressed as a hero, built to move other people where they need to be and then punish whoever they land on. Get the order of operations right and she is one of the most disruptive roamers in the game; get it wrong and she is a very fast hero with nothing useful to do.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"mathilda\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-favor-tempo\",\"name\":\"Roam Favor Tempo\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"cost\":1850,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"favor\",\"name\":\"Favor\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy draft is mostly physical contact damage and has limited chain crowd control.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when sustain fighters, attack-speed marksmen, or shield-heavy divers are the main problem.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one predictable dive combo can be stalled after Guiding Wind or Circling Eagle has already started.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked roam setup that turns Mathilda into a repeat engage and rescue tool with Favor, Flask, mana sustain, ultimate resets, and late revive insurance.\",\"totalCost\":10650,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":135,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Fleeting Time\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2850,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":38,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":50,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"healingEffect\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.healingEffect\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":12,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=mathilda\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cflask-of-the-oasis%2Cenchanted-talisman%2Cfleeting-time%2Coracle%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=favor\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=support\u0026talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cdominance-ice.oracle%2Cwinter-crown.immortality\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"roam-anti-sustain-defense\",\"name\":\"Roam Anti-Sustain Defense\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"cost\":1850,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"purify\",\"name\":\"Purify\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"favor\",\"name\":\"Favor\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when physical basic attacks and repeated contact matter more than crowd control duration.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against single-cycle magic burst that can remove Mathilda before Guiding Wind creates a save path.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against sustained magic poke or burn that chips Mathilda before Lord and Turtle fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when physical skill burst from fighters or assassins is forcing defensive ultimates too early.\"}],\"notes\":\"Defensive roam setup for brawl-heavy drafts where Purify protects Mathilda from CC chains and Dominance Ice punishes enemies who dive through her shield field.\",\"totalCost\":10610,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":135,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2250,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":75,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":78,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"healingEffect\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.healingEffect\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":12,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=mathilda\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cflask-of-the-oasis%2Cenchanted-talisman%2Cdominance-ice%2Coracle%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=favor\u0026spell=purify\u0026emblem=support\u0026talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark\u0026flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Cathenas-shield.oracle%2Cradiant-armor.oracle%2Cantique-cuirass.oracle\"},{\"slot\":3,\"id\":\"roam-dire-hit-burst\",\"name\":\"Roam Dire Hit Burst\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"cost\":2040,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"wilderness-blessing\",\"name\":\"Wilderness Blessing\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/wilderness-blessing.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"execute\",\"name\":\"Execute\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"dire-hit\",\"name\":\"Dire Hit\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when crowd control or magic burst matters more than early penetration.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your team has multiple magic damage dealers who can benefit from reduced enemy Magic Defense.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when Mathilda is snowballing and needs maximum shield and Soul Bloom scaling instead of a personal safety shield.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when late death timers matter more than extra magic power and movement speed.\"}],\"notes\":\"Damage roam setup for pickoff drafts. Mathilda charges Ancestral Guidance and Dire Hit Force off the same constant movement, so the enhanced Basic Attack carries the stack dump into Circling Eagle, Soul Bloom, and Execute.\",\"totalCost\":10920,\"statLines\":[{\